          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "A function $f(x)$ has values according to the table below:\n\n| $x$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ | $5$ | $6$ | $7$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $f(x)$ | $-1.0$ | $-0.7$ | $-0.3$ | $0.7$ | $1.5$ | $2.1$ |\n\nApproximate  at the point $x=3$ using a forward difference approximation.",
